# Database integrity

- Additive migrations only; reversible where practical.
- Preserve all original ebook record IDs. No silent deletes.
- `marketplace_listings.current_price` (not selling_price).
- `pricing_intelligence.recommended_selling_price` (not recommended_price).
- Cover status changes must be logged; never overwrite approved/manual covers.
- Dedup: soft-suppress + quarantine first; hard delete only after explicit admin approval.
- Backup / `rollback_data` required before any merge.
- Dashboard metrics must come from real DB queries, never mock numbers.
